{"3317130": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Born In War", "steam_appid": 3317130, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BEAT YOUR ONLINE ENEMIES!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your armor is shiny and impressive, and you certainly look charismatic. But I’d advise you to <strong>stay focused</strong>... Unexpected warriors may appear at any moment and leave a <strong>little scratch on your face. (Early Development)</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3317130/extras/fca7bfff7ae81e406f021cbed8cecd5b.poster.avif?t=1774801176\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3317130/extras/fca7bfff7ae81e406f021cbed8cecd5b.webm?t=1774801176\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3317130/extras/fca7bfff7ae81e406f021cbed8cecd5b.mp4?t=1774801176\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>CRAFT, EQUIP and FIGHT!</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can use the gold and materials you earn from battles against other <strong>online players</strong> to have the city’s finest blacksmith forge new gear, which you can then equip to your character. (2 slot hands, 8 slot armors)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But be careful, <strong>weight will make</strong> it harder for you to move.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3317130/extras/d5035297c3667764ddf7519a86acaba0.poster.avif?t=1774801176\" width=750 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3317130/extras/d5035297c3667764ddf7519a86acaba0.webm?t=1774801176\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3317130/extras/d5035297c3667764ddf7519a86acaba0.mp4?t=1774801176\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CITY ATMOSPHERE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3317130/extras/c4f0af90f105601ef59956876b461648.avif?t=1774801176\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3317130/extras_big/c4f0af90f105601ef59956876b461648.avif?t=1774801176 width=1560 height=750 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>PRECIOUS STONE!!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It would have been too simple and ordinary to bring armor into the game with only the base attributes provided by the blacksmith. To make things <strong>more complex</strong>, we added over <strong>20 precious gemstones</strong> that can be socketed into armor — each with a chance to break.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3317130/extras/58be18c2bf405ac28bf4ee283edfac90.poster.avif?t=1774801176\" width=750 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3317130/extras/58be18c2bf405ac28bf4ee283edfac90.webm?t=1774801176\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3317130/extras/58be18c2bf405ac28bf4ee283edfac90.mp4?t=1774801176\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>EARLY DEVELOPMENT!!!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We are actively <strong>continuing the development of Born In War.</strong> I’d like to remind you once again that the visuals and content you see are still in an <strong>early development stages</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BEAT YOUR ONLINE ENEMIES!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your armor is shiny and impressive, and you certainly look charismatic. But I’d advise you to <strong>stay focused</strong>... Unexpected warriors may appear at any moment and leave a <strong>little scratch on your face. (Early Development)</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3317130/extras/fca7bfff7ae81e406f021cbed8cecd5b.poster.avif?t=1774801176\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3317130/extras/fca7bfff7ae81e406f021cbed8cecd5b.webm?t=1774801176\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3317130/extras/fca7bfff7ae81e406f021cbed8cecd5b.mp4?t=1774801176\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>CRAFT, EQUIP and FIGHT!</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can use the gold and materials you earn from battles against other <strong>online players</strong> to have the city’s finest blacksmith forge new gear, which you can then equip to your character. (2 slot hands, 8 slot armors)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But be careful, <strong>weight will make</strong> it harder for you to move.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3317130/extras/d5035297c3667764ddf7519a86acaba0.poster.avif?t=1774801176\" width=750 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3317130/extras/d5035297c3667764ddf7519a86acaba0.webm?t=17748011