es</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "Born In War is an Online Turn-Based 2D medieval game where you rise to power by defeating your opponents. Upgrade your armor, craft items, and develop your oppressed character while competing against thousands of online players.", "supported_languages": "English, French, Italian, German, Simplified Chinese, Indonesian, Portuguese - Portugal, Turkish, Spanish - Spain, Bulgarian, Korean, Spanish - Latin America, Russian, Ukrainian, Vietnamese, Greek, Czech", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3317130/7c06b4f7eb9478066fa3c515129f9c6c8e525714/header.jpg?t=1774801176", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3317130/4c950d66cad76abac5bf3d1e2ae80797a57c955b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1774801176", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3317130/4c950d66cad76abac5bf3d1e2ae80797a57c955b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1774801176", "website": "https://www.quellstudios.com", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7/8/10 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> POTATO<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Intel HD 4000<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> POTATO<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvidia GTX 660 / AMD HD 7850<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> macOS 10.13 High Sierra<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> POTATO<br></li><li><strong>Memory